If you want brain-dead reliability (great for our first-game vibe—keep it fun, not finicky), yep, force a square bb using max(originalWidth, originalHeight) * sqrt(2) ~127 for diagonal worst-case (45°). Center the pivot in it. This over-allocates but guarantees no cull ever, and for tiny sprites? Negligible perf hit.

